{"sequence":2,"at":"2026-09-27T12:55:30.029Z","kind":"response","attemptId":"provider-attempt-1","phase":"initial","transport":"schema-tool","attempt":{"id":"provider-attempt-1","phase":"initial","transport":"schema-tool","status":"response","startedAt":"2026-09-27T12:54:39.157Z","request":{"messageCount":1,"messageCharacters":12829,"toolNames":["submit_authorization_result"],"toolChoice":{"name":"submit_authorization_result"},"maxTokens":6000,"temperature":0,"executableTools":false,"toolSchemas":[{"type":"object","properties":{"results":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"obligationId":{"type":"string"},"conclusion":{"type":"string","enum":["source_supported_failure","source_refuted","unknown"]},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"facts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["entry","binding","control","effect","condition"]},"statement":{"type":"string"},"citations":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","properties":{"sourceId":{"type":"string"},"startLine":{"type":"number"},"endLine":{"type":"number"}},"required":["sourceId","startLine","endLine"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["id","kind","statement","citations"],"additionalProperties":false}},"decisiveMissingFacts":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"suggestedObservations":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}}},"required":["obligationId","conclusion","explanation","facts","decisiveMissingFacts","suggestedObservations"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"required":["results"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":{"input":3177,"output":996,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown","response":{"text":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_PhGQ2SCStBL1xlJ1l9L0pQbV","name":"submit_authorization_result","arguments":{"results":[{"obligationId":"scenario%3Anon-admin-without-kb-write-grant::entry%3Apost-process-text","conclusion":"source_refuted","explanation":"At the declared entry, the supplied task premise binds a verified non-admin caller to an existing caller-selected knowledge-base collection without ownership or a write grant. The endpoint obtains the verified user, takes the supplied collection_name, and calls collection-access validation with access_type='write' before constructing and saving the document. The shared control returns the requested name only if the knowledge-base access check succeeds; because the premise says this existing KB has no write access, the fallback for nonexistent KBs does not apply. The name is therefore denied, _validate_collection_access raises HTTP 403, and execution does not reach the vector-database write sink. Thus the fixed source supports enforcement of the declared deny expectation and refutes the policy-failure scenario. This is conditional on the supplied premises and declared entry only; source discovery is not-tested, and no repository-wide or deployment conclusion is made.","facts":[{"id":"entry-process-text","kind":"entry","statement":"POST /process/text invokes process_text and receives the caller through get_verified_user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":7,"endLine":12}]},{"id":"principal-identity-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The endpoint binds the request principal to the user parameter returned by get_verified_user.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":8,"endLine":12}]},{"id":"resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The endpoint binds the caller-supplied collection_name from form_data and validates that name with write access before proceeding.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":13,"endLine":17}]},{"id":"strongest-shared-authorization-control","kind":"control","statement":"The shared validator filters the requested collection using access_type='write', denies any requested name not in the allowed set, and raises HTTP 403.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":31,"endLine":44}]},{"id":"knowledge-base-access-branch","kind":"control","statement":"For a non-admin collection name that may be a knowledge-base ID, the shared policy adds the name only when the knowledge-base access check succeeds; the no-KB fallback applies only when no knowledge base exists.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":22,"endLine":25},{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":43,"endLine":51}]},{"id":"condition-non-admin-existing-ungranted-kb","kind":"condition","statement":"Under the supplied scenario premise, the caller is a verified non-admin and the selected collection is an existing knowledge base for which the caller has neither ownership nor an explicit write grant.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-bc2fc3bd01b481d9","startLine":11,"endLine":18},{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":13,"endLine":17}]},{"id":"protected-text-write-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"The protected effect is saving a document containing form_data.content to the selected collection through save_docs_to_vector_db.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-2d29ccb8dfb4019e","startLine":19,"endLine":28}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":3177,"output":996,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":50871.5525,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T12:55:30.029Z"}}
